## Manual Testing Checklist

Test these scenarios when you run the app:

| # | Test | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Visit `/Restaurants` without logging in | Redirect to Login page |
| 2 | Login as **User** role, visit `/Restaurants` | ✅ Can view list |
| 3 | Login as **User** role, visit `/Restaurants/Create` | ❌ Access Denied |
| 4 | Login as **Admin** (`admin@gmail.com` / `Admin@123`) | ✅ Can Create/Edit/Delete |
| 5 | Create a restaurant as Admin | Check console for log message |
| 6 | Try a failed login with wrong password | Check console for warning log |
| 7 | Visit `/Error/404` directly | Custom themed 404 page |

